WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.340
Matthew 22

00:02.340 --> 00:06.920
And again Jesus spoke to them in parables, saying,

00:07.420 --> 00:12.500
The kingdom of heaven may be compared to a king who gave a wedding feast for his son,

00:12.860 --> 00:16.560
and sent his servants to call those who were invited to the wedding feast,

00:17.080 --> 00:18.520
but they would not come.

00:19.200 --> 00:21.380
Again he sent other servants, saying,

00:21.880 --> 00:23.280
Tell those who are invited,

00:23.740 --> 00:29.020
See, I have prepared my dinner, my oxen and my fat calves have been slaughtered,

00:29.020 --> 00:32.700
and everything is ready, come to the wedding feast.

00:33.340 --> 00:38.300
But they paid no attention and went off, one to his farm, another to his business,

00:38.780 --> 00:43.040
while the rest seized his servants, treated them shamefully, and killed them.

00:43.700 --> 00:49.820
The king was angry, and he sent his troops and destroyed those murderers and burned their city.

00:50.700 --> 00:52.280
Then he said to his servants,

00:52.800 --> 00:56.960
The wedding feast is ready, but those invited were not worthy.

00:57.260 --> 00:58.960
Go, therefore, to the mainstay,

00:59.020 --> 01:02.860
and invite to the wedding feast as many as you find.

01:03.540 --> 01:08.200
And those servants went out into the roads, and gathered all whom they found,

01:08.620 --> 01:13.020
both bad and good, so the wedding hall was filled with guests.

01:13.740 --> 01:16.560
But when the king came in to look at the guests,

01:17.020 --> 01:19.440
he saw there a man who had no wedding garment.

01:20.080 --> 01:21.380
And he said to him,

01:21.940 --> 01:24.960
Friend, how did you get in here without a wedding garment?

01:25.500 --> 01:26.880
And he was speechless.

01:26.880 --> 01:28.880
Then the king said to the servants,

01:29.580 --> 01:46.940
Then the Pharisees went and plotted how to entangle him in his words.

01:47.400 --> 01:51.300
And they sent their disciples to him, along with the Herodians, saying,

01:51.940 --> 01:57.940
Teacher, we know that you are true and teach the way of God truthfully,

01:58.140 --> 01:59.000
and you do not know how to do it.

01:59.000 --> 02:03.980
Do not care about anyone's opinion, for you are not swayed by appearances.

02:05.320 --> 02:07.720
Tell us, then, what you think.

02:08.440 --> 02:13.300
Is it lawful to pay taxes to Caesar or not?

02:13.940 --> 02:17.300
But Jesus, aware of their malice, said,

02:18.100 --> 02:20.900
Why put me to the test, you hypocrites?

02:22.000 --> 02:24.140
Show me the coin for the tax.

02:24.780 --> 02:26.300
And they brought him a denarius.

02:26.300 --> 02:27.880
And Jesus said to them,

02:27.880 --> 02:31.340
Whose likeness and inscription is this?

02:32.060 --> 02:32.640
They said,

02:33.440 --> 02:34.600
Caesar's.

02:35.340 --> 02:36.540
Then he said to them,

02:37.300 --> 02:40.980
Therefore, render to Caesar the things that are Caesar's,

02:41.540 --> 02:44.900
and to God the things that are God's.

02:45.580 --> 02:49.600
When they heard it, they marveled, and they left him and went away.

02:50.540 --> 02:54.820
The same day Sadducees came to him who say that there is no resurrection,

02:54.820 --> 02:57.740
and they asked him a question, saying,

02:57.880 --> 03:00.940
Teacher, Moses said,

03:00.940 --> 03:03.380
If a man dies having no children,

03:03.780 --> 03:07.720
his brother must marry the widow and raise up children for his brother.

03:08.480 --> 03:11.240
Now there were seven brothers among us.

03:11.900 --> 03:13.700
The first married and died,

03:14.020 --> 03:17.200
and having no children, left his wife to his brother.

03:18.180 --> 03:21.560
So too the second and third, down to the seventh.

03:22.320 --> 03:24.460
After them all, the woman died.

03:25.380 --> 03:27.220
In the resurrection, therefore,

03:27.220 --> 03:32.120
of the seven whose wife will she be, for they all had her.

03:32.820 --> 03:34.260
But Jesus answered them,

03:34.960 --> 03:40.240
You are wrong, because you know neither the scriptures nor the power of God.

03:40.840 --> 03:45.320
For in the resurrection they neither marry nor are given in marriage,

03:45.700 --> 03:47.440
but are like angels in heaven.

03:48.100 --> 03:50.100
And as for the resurrection of the dead,

03:50.660 --> 03:53.280
have you not read what was said to you by God?

03:53.780 --> 03:55.960
I am the God of Abraham,

03:56.380 --> 03:57.200
and the God of Israel,

03:57.200 --> 03:57.800
and the God of Isaac,

03:58.060 --> 03:59.240
and the God of Jacob.

04:00.200 --> 04:02.240
He is not God of the dead,

04:02.680 --> 04:03.640
but of the living.

04:04.620 --> 04:05.880
And when the crowd heard it,

04:05.900 --> 04:07.680
they were astonished at his teaching.

04:08.340 --> 04:12.160
But when the Pharisees heard that he had silenced the Sadducees,

04:13.060 --> 04:14.080
they gathered together,

04:14.200 --> 04:15.780
and one of them, a lawyer,

04:16.400 --> 04:18.520
asked him a question to test him.

04:19.200 --> 04:22.200
Teacher, which is the great commandment in the law?

04:22.980 --> 04:24.100
And he said to him,

04:24.520 --> 04:27.100
You shall love the Lord your God,

04:27.800 --> 04:29.140
with all your heart,

04:29.400 --> 04:30.860
and with all your soul,

04:31.100 --> 04:32.540
and with all your mind.

04:33.040 --> 04:35.520
This is the great and first commandment,

04:35.920 --> 04:37.420
and a second is like it.

04:37.920 --> 04:40.560
You shall love your neighbor as yourself.

04:41.320 --> 04:45.160
On these two commandments depend all the law and the prophets.

04:45.880 --> 04:48.740
Now, while the Pharisees were gathered together,

04:49.180 --> 04:52.060
Jesus asked them a question, saying,

04:52.360 --> 04:54.640
What do you think about the Christ?

04:55.080 --> 04:56.600
Whose son is he?

04:57.200 --> 04:58.260
They said to him,

04:58.960 --> 05:00.040
The son of David.

05:00.880 --> 05:02.300
He said to them,

05:03.100 --> 05:05.920
How is it then that David, in the Spirit,

05:06.360 --> 05:07.700
calls him Lord, saying,

05:08.200 --> 05:09.740
The Lord said to my Lord,

05:09.960 --> 05:11.180
Sit at my right hand,

05:11.520 --> 05:13.720
until I put your enemies under your feet?

05:14.700 --> 05:16.940
If then David calls him Lord,

05:17.380 --> 05:19.200
how is he his son?

05:19.720 --> 05:22.900
And no one was able to answer him a word,

05:22.900 --> 05:27.040
nor from that day did anyone dare to ask him any more questions.

05:27.200 --> 05:30.600
Thus the Christ was slain.

05:30.680 --> 05:32.880
We ask such a question of God.

05:32.960 --> 05:36.340
A question like this is asking God for forgiveness.

05:36.420 --> 05:39.540
To get penitence for such a sin,

05:39.920 --> 05:41.560
is not easy.

05:41.860 --> 05:43.640
It is an experiment,

05:44.020 --> 05:45.180
not a poem.

05:45.640 --> 05:47.320
It is a very bizarre fact.

05:47.960 --> 05:51.280
It is presented появonly by the people.

05:51.540 --> 05:52.920
It is very profound.

05:53.120 --> 05:53.560
The Bible says,

05:53.960 --> 05:55.760
A city with a mountain,

05:56.060 --> 05:56.920
having been built,

